  "fragments": [
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_01",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "gray",
      "character": "Narrator",
      "text": "每周三的晚上，澪和栞会约在同一个常驻 World 里，已经持续了一年。",
      "tags": ["anchor", "start"],
      "draggable": false,
      "valence": 0,
      "note": "固定起点。习惯本身是温暖的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_02",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "white",
      "character": "Shiori",
      "text": "这周三，栞没有上线。",
      "tags": ["absence"],
      "draggable": true,
      "valence": -1,
      "note": "缺席。它本身很轻，但会因为前后的排列变重。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_03",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "white",
      "character": "Mio",
      "text": "澪在 World 里站了很久，没有人来打招呼。",
      "tags": ["waiting"],
      "draggable": true,
      "valence": -1,
      "note": "等待。它出现得越早，澪越像是在一直等。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_04",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "white",
      "character": "Mio",
      "text": "澪发了一条：「你今晚还来吗？」然后盯着输入框，等了很久。",
      "tags": ["reach_out"],
      "draggable": true,
      "valence": 1,
      "note": "澪的主动。它是这一关的核心动作。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_05",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "white",
      "character": "Narrator",
      "text": "好友列表里，栞的名字还是亮的，只是一直没有回复。",
      "tags": ["silence"],
      "draggable": true,
      "valence": -1,
      "note": "沉默。它只是事实，没有解释。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_06",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "white",
      "character": "Shiori",
      "text": "栞在别人的私聊里留了一句：「最近很累，先不去了。」但没有对澪说。",
      "tags": ["hidden_reason"],
      "draggable": true,
      "valence": 0,
      "note": "栞的真实原因。它被别人看见，却没有到达澪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_07",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "white",
      "character": "Mio",
      "text": "澪想了很久，最后只写了一句：「没关系，你忙你的。」",
      "tags": ["self_erasure"],
      "draggable": true,
      "valence": -1,
      "note": "体谅，也是退让。它的意义由前面有没有人说过原因决定。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_08",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "gray",
      "character": "Narrator",
      "text": "那个周三的时段，World 里的同行位置，再也没有被填满。",
      "tags": ["anchor", "end"],
      "draggable": false,
      "valence": 0,
      "note": "固定终点。中性：空位可以是'等待'，也可以是'告别'。"
    },
    {
      "id": "frag_5_2_09",
      "levelId": "5-2",
      "type": "blue",
      "character": "Mio",
      "text": "【澪的独白】我不敢问她为什么。问了，就只能接受那个答案。",
      "tags": ["insight"],
      "draggable": false,
      "valence": 0,
      "hidden": true,
      "unlockedBy": "ending:5-2:good",
      "note": "通关 5-2 的 good 结局后解锁的氛围碎片。"
    }
  ],
